sequenceDiagram
    participant CM as client-management
    participant Q as Queue (SNS/SQS)
    participant W as notification worker
    participant NS as NotificationService
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Coach as Any coach of the client

    CM->>Q: publish uploaded/removed { client_id, actor_id, count }
    Q->>W: consume
    W->>NS: onConsultationDocumentUploaded / Removed(payload)
    NS->>NS: getAllTrainerIds(client), take the owner coach
    NS->>DB: create one Notification (inAppOnly)<br>user = owner coach, relate_user = client
    Coach->>DB: Updates feed: user in trainer ids, relate_user = client
    DB-->>Coach: the same single row
